{"kind":"finding","id":"FN-B-run-phone-native-a-01","date":"2026-11-24","lens":"15","surface":"phone","area":"phone/native","refs":["FN-L14-phone-native-01"],"severity":"S3","title":"When the phone app crashes in its own Android parts, MettleUp is never told","what":"Crash reports only catch errors in the app screens. A crash in the phone side parts (the rest timer and its alarm, a tap on the notification with the app closed, the widgets, a watch button, Health Connect, or a deep crash like the one Device QA once found when a box opened over a list) closes the app or does nothing, and no report reaches MettleUp. Only Google Play's own crash page could show it, nobody is alerted from there, and copies installed from GitHub are not on it at all.","expected":"Crashes in the Android parts are reported the same way screen crashes are, or a daily check of Play crash numbers raises an alert.","evidence":["apps/mobile/src/lib/crashReport.ts:1-12","apps/mobile/src/lib/crashReport.ts:83-91","apps/mobile/android/app/src/main/java/com/forgeai/app/MainApplication.kt:33-56","apps/mobile/android/app/src/main/java/com/forgeai/app/MainApplication.kt:42-46","apps/mobile/modules/forge-rest/android/src/main/java/com/forgeai/rest/RestActionReceiver.kt:21-70"],"proof":"code-read","root_cause_key":"native-crashes-never-reported","who":"members","how_often":"whenever a phone side part crashes","fix_line":"Send Android side crashes to the same crash report, or alert daily on Play crash numbers","fix_size":"medium","needs_him":false,"verified":"pending","status":"open"}
{"kind":"finding","id":"FN-B-run-phone-native-a-02","date":"2026-11-24","lens":"15","surface":"phone","area":"phone/native","refs":["FN-B-run-phone-lib-core-a-06"],"severity":"S4","title":"MettleUp cannot see how many members use the rest alert, watch app, widgets, reminders or Health Connect","what":"Whether a member turned on reminders, Health Connect, weigh-in reading or sleep tips, added a widget, has the watch app, or allowed exact alarms for the rest alert is kept only on the phone. Nothing is counted anywhere, so choices such as putting the watch behind MettleUp Plus, or how hard to push the alert check-up, are made without knowing how many members use these.","expected":"A few private, anonymous counts of which phone features are switched on, so these product decisions rest on numbers.","evidence":["apps/mobile/src/tracker/phone/phonePrefs.ts:145-218","apps/mobile/modules/forge-phone/android/src/main/java/com/forgeai/phone/Widgets.kt:169-170","apps/mobile/modules/forge-rest/android/src/main/java/com/forgeai/rest/ForgeRestModule.kt:141","apps/mobile/modules/forge-rest/android/src/main/java/com/forgeai/rest/ForgeRestModule.kt:304-311"],"proof":"code-read","root_cause_key":"native-feature-use-not-counted","who":"owner","how_often":"always","fix_line":"Count which phone features are on, without personal data","fix_size":"medium","needs_him":true,"verified":"pending","status":"open"}
